--- !u!114 &1896539221
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1896539217}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 808348c2f7da49f4cbca9a86d29b3619, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - ...You carry the scent of smoke and battle. Not many in this quiet town do.
  - Tell me, what brings a daughter of the rebellion this far from the front?
  - ...Loss, is it? I see it in your eyes. Grief is a heavier chain than any the
    Imperium forged.
  - But chains can be broken. Even the ones wrapped around the heart.
  - "You seek the tower, don\u2019t you? The one people pretend is a myth. A spire
    that pierces the clouds... and the truth."
  - Many climb it for gold. Others for power. But you... you climb for someone you
    could not save.
  - "They say the Victor\u2019s Laurel grants one desire to the champion who survives
    the ascent."
  - "If your heart truly burns for that wish\u2026 the tower will call to you."
  - But hear this warning, barbarian. Every step upward tears something away. Flesh,
    resolve... sometimes even the soul.
  - Still... you have the look of one who would rather die trying than live with
    regret. Good. The tower favors those who refuse to turn back.
  - When you are ready, take your first steps. The climb begins the moment you choose
    to ascend.
